    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gallagher Auctioneers brings to the market this two bedroom mid terraced house located in Lis Cara, Carrick on Shannon. The property comprises of entrance hall, kitchen/diner, downstairs WC, living room with double doors leading to rear garden. Stairs leads to first floor comprising of two double bedrooms with built in wardrobes, one with ensuite bathroom and separate family bathroom. The property is newly painted throughout. Parking to the front of the property. Located approximately 1km from the town centre and all shops, schools, leisure facilities, restaurants, hotels, riverside walks and Carrick on Shannon train station which serves the Dublin/Sligo line. For all viewings contact Gallagher Auctioneers on 0719621000."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall 1.58m (5'2\") x 1.41m (4'8\")\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner 4.45m (14'7\") x 2.41m (7'11\")\r\n\r\nWC 1.58m (5'2\") x 1.42m (4'8\")\r\n\r\nLiving Room 4.01m (13'2\") x 3.58m (11'9\")\r\n\r\nStairs to First Floor \r\n\r\nLanding 3.08m (10'1\") x 2.01m (6'7\")\r\n\r\nBedroom One 3.54m (11'7\") x 2.98m (9'9\")\r\n\r\nEnsuite 3.43m (11'3\") x 0.9m (2'11\")\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.24m (7'4\") x 1.87m (6'2\")\r\n\r\nBedroom Two 4m (13'1\") x 2.72m (8'11\")"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Two bedroom mid terraced house \r\n\r\nLocated within walking distance of the town centre\r\n\r\nNewly painted throughout\r\n\r\nParking to the front of the property \r\n\r\nRear garden"
